        {
          "text": "Amane kucita obo, ajaye iŋombe kubusyu bwa-Jehova, Lino bapaizi bana ba-Aroni batambule bulowa, basansaile bulowa koonse koonse cakuzyunguluka cipaililo cili kumulyango watente lyambunganino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
